Template: odoo-erpnet-fp/enroll_code
Type: string
Default:
Description: Enrollment code for remote access (optional):
 Paste the enrollment code you received for this machine (it starts with
 EFP1.). It connects this machine to its own private Cloudflare tunnel.
 Leave it empty for a local-only install; on an upgrade an existing
 enrollment is kept. You can enroll later with: sudo erpnet-fp-enroll apply
